! Mandarin Audio Lab

A technical pilot for the workflow ''audio recording → repository → static GitHub Pages → playback within a vocabulary entry''.

!! 你好 · nǐ hǎo · hello

<div class="mandarin-audio"><audio controls="controls" preload="none" src="audio/nihao.mp3">Your browser does not support this audio player.</audio><div class="mandarin-audio-caption">Human recording; listen for third-tone sandhi. [[Vocabulary/你好]]</div></div>

This clip is adapted from a licensed Wikimedia Commons recording credited in [[Audio Attribution]]. We deliberately did ''not'' use the available offline synthesizer: its Mandarin dictionary was incomplete, so its output could not be trusted as a tone model.

!! Next tests
* Verify desktop and mobile playback on the deployed site.
* Add sound-label metadata to the vocabulary schema.
* Compare native speaker, licensed voice recordings, and high-quality Mandarin TTS before bulk generation.
* Build blind listening exercises that hide Hanzi and pinyin until after a learner answers.

